{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An easy-to-play, fast-paced bullet-hell idle roguelike set in space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last hope of the Swarm. Against endless fleets\u2014how long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/fdbc4a7e767d9a5b42b47742cd85b88a.poster.avif?t=1773133786\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/fdbc4a7e767d9a5b42b47742cd85b88a.webm?t=1773133786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/fdbc4a7e767d9a5b42b47742cd85b88a.mp4?t=1773133786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Minimal Controls, Maximum Satisfaction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No movement. No item pickup. Fully automated combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Rich Skills and Build Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ skills, diverse enemies and characters, multiple planets, plus relics and modifiers with random drops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Fast Builds, Instant Carnage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamlined progression lets your build come online quickly. Watch your skills and bullets fill the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Endless Mode Challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources wisely and push your limits against relentless enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Speed-Up &amp; Idle Mode Supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the game in the corner of your screen and keep battling while you work or browse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c